@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 내 양 착용 상태와 제공 아이템 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/avatar/outfit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 모자 장착
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/avatar/outfit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slot":"HAT","itemCode":"STRAW_HAT"}

### 브라운 집업 재킷 장착
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/avatar/outfit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slot":"TOP","itemCode":"TAN_ZIP_JACKET"}

### 모자 해제
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/avatar/outfit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slot":"HAT","itemCode":null}
